kingcobra (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support for ARM64, ARMhf and RISC-V (interpreter; JIT is amd64 only).
  * The JIT probes the platform and falls back to the interpreter.
  * New --no-jit option and KC_JIT=0.
  * int(float) is now saturating and identical on every CPU.

 -- Divyanshu Sinha <divyanshu.sinha631@gmail.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
